 "steps": [
  {
   "id": "s0",
   "title": "Resolve the launch velocity",
   "text": "A ball is launched at speed \\( v_i \\) and angle \\( \\theta \\). Split it: \\( v_x = v_i\\cos\\theta = {{vx|1}} \\) and \\( v_{y0} = v_i\\sin\\theta = {{vy0|1}} \\) m s⁻¹.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 0,
      "ph": 0,
      "vi": 20,
      "th": 30
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "title": "Rising",
   "text": "Gravity pulls only vertically: \\( v_y \\) shrinks while \\( v_x \\) stays the same.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 1,
      "vi": 20,
      "th": 30
     },
     "at": 0
    },
    {
     "tween": {
      "ph": 0.5
     },
     "at": 0,
     "dur": 3200
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Highest point",
   "text": "At the top \\( v_y = 0 \\), so the velocity is **horizontal** (\\( v = v_x \\)). \\( H = \\dfrac{v_i^2\\sin^2\\theta}{2g} = {{H|1}} \\) m.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 2,
      "ph": 0.5,
      "vi": 20,
      "th": 30
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "title": "Landing",
   "text": "The flight is symmetric: \\( T = \\dfrac{2v_i\\sin\\theta}{g} = {{T|2}} \\) s and \\( R = \\dfrac{v_i^2\\sin2\\theta}{g} = {{R|1}} \\) m.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 3,
      "vi": 20,
      "th": 30
     },
     "at": 0
    },
    {
     "tween": {
      "ph": 1
     },
     "at": 0,
     "dur": 3200
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "title": "Try 45°",
   "text": "At \\( \\theta = 45^\\circ \\) the range is greatest. Drag the sliders to explore \\( v_i \\) and \\( \\theta \\).",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 3,
      "ph": 0,
